IMAPAccount protonmail
Host 127.0.0.1
Port 1143
User nilseckerle2001@protonmail.com
PassCmd "grep imap_pass ~/.config/mutt/passwords.env | cut -d'\"' -f2"
SSLType None
Timeout 120

IMAPStore protonmail-remote
Account protonmail

MaildirStore protonmail-local
Path ~/Mail/
Inbox ~/Mail/INBOX
SubFolders Verbatim

Channel protonmail-inbox
Far :protonmail-remote:INBOX
Near :protonmail-local:INBOX
Create Both
Expunge Both
SyncState *

Channel protonmail-sent
Far :protonmail-remote:Sent
Near :protonmail-local:Sent
Create Both
Expunge Both
SyncState *

Channel protonmail
Far :protonmail-remote:
Near :protonmail-local:
Patterns * !INBOX !Sent
Create Both
Expunge Both
SyncState *
